	<key>readme</key>
	<string># ClipSync

Syncs the clipboard between this Mac and the ClipSync Android app.

- **clip**: status and actions (pair a phone, send the clipboard, pause or resume auto-sync, start or stop the agent)
- **Hotkey** (set one yourself): send the Mac clipboard to the phone
- **Universal Action "Send to phone clipboard"**: send selected text or an Alfred clipboard-history entry

Copies on the Mac go to the phone automatically while the agent runs. On the phone, send a clip with the Quick Settings tile, the notification action, Share, or "Send to Mac" in the text-selection menu.

Items that password managers mark as concealed are never auto-synced.</string>
